{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-06-07 16:32:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION NAMED ACC RESPONSIBLE CARE COMPANY OF THE YEAR', 'text': 'FMC PREVIOUSLY WON THE AWARD IN 2017, 2019 AND 2020. PHILADELPHIA , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) WAS HONORED TODAY BY THE AMERICAN CHEMISTRY COUNCIL (ACC) AS THE RESPONSIBLE CARE COMPANY OF THE YEAR, AN AWARD RECOGNIZING FMC FOR ITS EXCELLENCE AND LEADERSHIP IN ENVIRONMENTAL, HEALTH, SAFETY AND SECURITY (EHS&S) PERFORMANCE.'}